er the construction starts.\\\\n                                    deposits.\\\\n\\\\n                                    Legally, compensation for the\\\\n                                    acquired land does not have to be\\\\n                                    paid before possession can be taken.\\\\n\\\\n                                    In practice, compensation is not paid\\\\n                                    promptly most of the time, and delays\\\\n                                    are not rectified by paying the interest\\\\n                                    rate as required by the law.\\\\nCalculation of compensation and     According to the Land Assessment of      WB OP 4.12 requires that the              Tanzanian law provides for the\\\\nvaluation                           the value of Land for Compensation)      displaced persons be provided with        calculation of compensation on the\\\\nTypes of affected Persons\\/Lost   Tanzanian Law                               World Bank OP 4.12                     Comparison\\/Gaps\\\\nAssets\\\\n                                 Regulations, 2001, as well as the Village   prompt and effective compensation at   basis of the market value of the lost\\\\n                                 Land Regulations, 2001, compensation        full replacement cost for losses of    land and unexhausted improvements,\\\\n                                 for loss of any interest inland shall       assets attributable direct to the      plus a disturbance, accommodation,\\\\n                                 include the value of unexhausted            project.                               and accommodation allowance, and\\\\n                                 improvements, disturbance                                                          loss of profits where applicable.\\\\n                                 allowance, transport allowance,         Replacement cost is the method of\\\\n                                