AP for the sub-\\\\n           project;\\\\n\\\\n      (iii) Relevant laws ( including customary and traditional law) governing\\\\n            land tenure, valuation of assets and losses, compensation, and\\\\n            natural resource usage rights, customary personal law; communal\\\\n\\\\nENVIRONMENTAL RESOURCES MANAGEMENT                                     SAGCOT RPF\\\\n                                         82\\\\n          laws, etc related to displacement and resettlement, and\\\\n          environmental laws and social welfare legislation;\\\\n\\\\n      (iv) Laws and regulations relating to the agencies responsible for\\\\n           implementing resettlement activities in the sub-projects;\\\\n\\\\n      (v) Gaps, if any, between local laws covering resettlement and the\\\\n          Bank\\u201fs resettlement policy, and the mechanisms for addressing such\\\\n          gaps; and\\\\n\\\\n      (vi) Legal steps necessary to ensure the effective implementation of RAP\\\\n           activities in the sub-projects, including, as appropriate, a process for\\\\n           recognizing claims to legal rights to land, including claims that\\\\n           derive from customary and traditional usage, etc and which are\\\\n           specific to the sub-projects\' and `automatic` = 1 and `color` = \'lightblue\') order by `highlights`.`policy_document_id` asc, `highlights`.`start_offset` asc limit 1\",\"time\":\"0.86\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":75,\"hash\":\"c9ec6d28cfc0ee0290aeda4897106aba\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:19'),(797,'a068f952-23c6-4264-bbec-f1566c7c8ebd','a068f952-cb06-4a22-ab61-57bcdf5d88c9',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"insert into `highlights` (`policy_document_id`, `start_offset`, `end_offset`, `extract`, `automatic`, `color`, `updated_at`, `created_at`) values (1, 248216, 250138, \'Legal Framework: The analysis of the legal and institutional framework should\\\\ncover the following:\\\\n\\\\n      (i) Scope of existing land and property laws governing resources,\\\\n          including state-owned lands under eminent domain and the nature\\\\n          of compensation associated with valuation methodologies; land\\\\n          market; mode and timing of payments, etc;\\\\n\\\\n      (ii) Applicable legal and administrative procedures, including a\\\\n           description of the grievance procedures and remedies available to\\\\n           PAPs in the judicial process and the execution of these procedures,\\\\n           including any available alternative dispute resolution mechanisms\\\\n           that may be relevant to implementation of the RAP for the sub-\\\\n           project;\\\\n\\\\n      (iii) Relevant laws ( including customary and traditional law) governing\\\\n            land tenure, valuation of assets and losses, compensation, and\\\\n            natural resource usage rights, customary personal law; communal\\\\n\\\\nENVIRONMENTAL RESOURCES MANAGEMENT                                     SAGCOT RPF\\\\n                                         82\\\\n          laws, etc related to displacement and resettlement, and\\\\n          environmental laws and social welfare legislation;\\\\n\\\\n      (iv) Laws and regulations relating to the agencies responsible for\\\\n           implementing resettlement activities in the sub-projects;\\\\n\\\\n      (v) Gaps, if any, between local laws covering resettlement and the\\\\n          Bank\\u201fs resettlement policy, and the mechanisms for addressing such\\\\n          gaps; and\\\\n\\\\n      (vi) Legal steps necessary to ensure the effective implementation of RAP\\\\n           activities in the sub-projects, including, as appropriate, a process for\\\\n           recognizing claims to legal rights to land, including claims that\\\\n           derive from customary and traditional usage, etc and which are\\\\n           specific to the sub-projects\', 1, \'lightblue\', \'2025-11-21 12:13:19\', \'2025-11-21 12:13:19\')\",\"time\":\"3.59\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":75,\"hash\":\"63b2254e6111491f0ef45d7bab50e1c6\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:19'),(798,'a068f952-23d5-441b-afc6-4529d2a2ba0b','a068f952-cb06-4a22-ab61-57bcdf5d88c9',NULL,1,'model','{\"action\":\"created\",\"model\":\"App\\\\Models\\\\Highlight:74\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:19'),(799,'a068f952-2422-409c-afa8-e07a3cef31c3','a068f952-cb06-4a22-ab61-57bcdf5d88c9',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"select * from `highlight_priority_action` where `highlight_priority_action`.`priority_action_id` = \'1.2\'\",\"time\":\"0.52\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":85,\"hash\":\"244902028077a568c47e57407a98d2e7\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:19'),(800,'a068f952-249d-4b7b-8e50-ff36ac3dc88a','a068f952-cb06-4a22-ab61-57bcdf5d88c9',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"insert into `highlight_priority_action` (`highlight_id`, `priority_action_id`) values (74, \'1.2\')\",\"time\":\"0.72\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":85,\"hash\":\"715a8339f6bd4b335213a87d64010af6\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:19'),(801,'a068f952-30a6-4633-be2d-5dab798d25c5','a068f952-cb06-4a22-ab61-57bcdf5d88c9',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"select * from `highlights` where (`policy_document_id` = 1 and `start_offset` = 251295 and `end_offset` = 251308 and `extract` = \'market rates)\' a