 rice\\\\nover other food crops for income generation and enhancing household food security; availability of some\\\\nimproved rice production technologies and dissemination channels, and availability of some programmes\\\\nfor increasing production and productivity of cereals including rice\' and `automatic` = 1 and `color` = \'lightblue\') order by `highlights`.`policy_document_id` asc, `highlights`.`start_offset` asc limit 1\",\"time\":\"2.14\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":75,\"hash\":\"c9ec6d28cfc0ee0290aeda4897106aba\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:26'),(1512,'a068f95d-0cae-4d6a-97d3-2f92bf61515e','a068f95d-7f0a-4c5c-bbb0-c17186b10d0e',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"insert into `highlights` (`policy_document_id`, `start_offset`, `end_offset`, `extract`, `automatic`, `color`, `updated_at`, `created_at`) values (3, 5855, 6341, \'The existing potentials for rice production in Tanzania include: rainfed - upland, and lowlands and irrigated\\\\nlowlands eco-systems; range of small, medium and large scale producers; comparative advantage of rice\\\\nover other food crops for income generation and enhancing household food security; availability of some\\\\nimproved rice production technologies and dissemination channels, and availability of some programmes\\\\nfor increasing production and productivity of cereals including rice\', 1, \'lightblue\', \'2025-11-21 12:13:26\', \'2025-11-21 12:13:26\')\",\"time\":\"1.15\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":75,\"hash\":\"63b2254e6111491f0ef45d7bab50e1c6\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:26'),(1513,'a068f95d-0cb7-4250-a17e-a6cb96463a4a','a068f95d-7f0a-4c5c-bbb0-c17186b10d0e',NULL,1,'model','{\"action\":\"created\",\"model\":\"App\\\\Models\\\\Hi