ystem resulting in quality\\\\n           deterioration and huge post-harvest losses;\\\\n   (iii)   Inadequate storage, packing technology and processing facilities which in turn\\\\n           create gluts and severe shortages of these items;\\\\n   (iv)    Poor roads, particularly feeder roads, and inadequate and inappropriate transport\\\\n           equipment\', 1, \'lightblue\', \'2025-11-21 12:13:41\', \'2025-11-21 12:13:41\')\",\"time\":\"1.04\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":75,\"hash\":\"63b2254e6111491f0ef45d7bab50e1c6\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:41'),(3323,'a068f973-81a1-46f7-9cb6-6fd1088e871a','a068f977-7c88-4902-9514-858c511be0b4',NULL,1,'model','{\"action\":\"created\",\"model\":\"App\\\\Models\\\\Highlight:522\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:41'),(3324,'a068f973-823c-40b7-83be-1698761d3d39','a068f977-7c88-4902-9514-858c511be0b4',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"select * from `highlight_priority_action` where `highlight_priority_action`.`priority_action_id` = \'1.2\'\",\"time\":\"1.32\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":85,\"hash\":\"244902028077a568c47e57407a98d2e7\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:41'),(3325,'a068f973-8384-4364-b4fe-b25367e4aab0','a068f977-7c88-4902-9514-858c511be0b4',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"insert into `highlight_priority_action` (`highlight_id`, `priority_action_id`) values (522, \'1.2\')\",\"time\":\"1.25\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":85,\"hash\":\"715a8339f6bd4b335213a87d64010af6\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:41'),(3326,'a068f973-8a60-4f81-b886-d2cd4222237d','a068f977-7c88-4902-9514-858c511be0b4',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"select * from `highlights` where (`policy_document_id` = 5 and `start_offset` = 119770 and `end_offset` = 120474 and `extract` = \'To gain access to the export\\\\nmarkets, the country needs to tackle the following constraints: -\\\\n\\\\n   (i)     To meet stringent product specifications, which include uniform size, colour,\\\\n           variety and other characteristics, which constitute the desired quality,\\\\n           demanded by extremely discriminating consumers;\\\\n   (ii)    To meet market requirements, which implies that supply must be regular and\\\\n           dependable;\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    40\\\\n   (iii)   To meet shipping schedule, meaning that road transport must be efficient and\\\\n           dependable, and that availability of air or ship cargo space must be adequate and\\\\n           regular;\\\\n   (iv)    Export procedures must be fast and efficient\' and `automatic` = 1 and `color` = \'lightblue\') order by `highlights`.`policy_document_id` asc, `highlights`.`start_offset` asc limit 1\",\"time\":\"1.57\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":75,\"hash\":\"c9ec6d28cfc0ee0290aeda4897106aba\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:41'),(3327,'a068f973-8af7-443f-9646-fde8d09ff4a4','a068f977-7c88-4902-9514-858c511be0b4',NULL,1,'query','{\"connection\":\"mysql\",\"driver\":\"mysql\",\"bindings\":[],\"sql\":\"select * from `highlight_priority_action` where `highlight_priority_action`.`priority_action_id` = \'1.2\'\",\"time\":\"1.15\",\"slow\":false,\"file\":\"\\/Users\\/dave\\/Sites\\/ae-policy-tracking-tool\\/app\\/Jobs\\/PolicyDocumentAutoSearch.php\",\"line\":85,\"hash\":\"244902028077a568c47e57407a98d2e7\",\"hostname\":\"dave-mbp\"}','2025-11-21 12:13:41'),(3328,'a068f973-920d-4cde-a2f7-92f86d708d